OL,3,GNEWSAArmed officer heard 'horrendous
OL,4,Ascream' - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firearms officer heard a "horrendous
OL,7,Fscream" from a house where a man posed
OL,8,Fa high threat to a child, an inquest
OL,9,Fjury was told.
OL,11,FSergii Kuzmenko, a Ukrainian who "spoke
OL,12,Flimited English", was fatally shot by
OL,13,FCumbria Police officers responding to
OL,14,Freports of a man making threats to kill
OL,15,Fwhile a young child was present.
OL,17,FIt happened at a house on Borland
OL,18,FAvenue in Carlisle six days before
OL,19,FChristmas 2022 and followed a 999 call
OL,20,Ffrom the man's sister.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
