OL,4,Ascream' - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a previous hearing, the coroner
OL,7,Fruled the two armed officers who shot
OL,8,FKuzmenko along with two other armed
OL,9,Fcolleagues would be granted anonymity
OL,10,Fon the basis their safety could be at
OL,11,Frisk if their identities were revealed.
